{
  "name": "Relentless Hex",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your curse creates a temporary bond between you and your target. As a Bonus Action, you can magically teleport up to 30 feet to an unoccupied space you can see within 5 feet of the target cursed by your Hex spell or by a warlock feature of yours, such as Hexblade's Curse or Sign of Ill Omen. To teleport in this way, you must be able to see the cursed target.</p>",
